n a statement.\"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"\\\"Their unique blend of European flair and athletic prowess will undoubtedly bring a new level of excitement to our league.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Nõmme Kalju FC, which has won several domestic titles in Estonia, including the Meistriliiga championship, has been looking to expand its reach beyond European borders.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"According to sources close to the club, the decision to join the NCAA was motivated by a desire to tap into the vast talent pool of American college basketball players.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"We believe that our football background will bring a new dimension to the game of basketball,\\\" said Nõmme Kalju FC's chairman, Kuno Tehva, in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"Our players are known for their technical skill and physical fitness, which we believe will translate well to the basketball court.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"The club has already begun recruiting top American college players, with several high-profile signings expected to be announced in the coming weeks.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"According to sources, Nõmme Kalju FC has been in talks with several top-ranked NCAA programs, including Duke, Kentucky, and North Carolina.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"While some have expressed skepticism about the move, citing the vastly different rules and styles of play between football and basketball, others see it as a bold and innovative step forward for the sport.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"\\\"This is a game-changer for college basketball,\\\" said ESPN analyst, Jay Bilas.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"\\\"Nõmme Kalju FC's entry into the NCAA will bring a level of international flair and competition that we've never seen before.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"It's going to be fascinating to watch.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"The club is expected to begin play in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the 2023-2024 season, with its home games to be played at the University of Maryland's Xfinity Center.\"}]}"
